anything elsewhere that looks like an additional coin. Keep this entire mount within the upper 75% (y<1440) of the portrait.\n\nTypography specification for the final composite only: MONEYBERG NEWS BRIEF is a compact one-line 35px Lato Black 900 label, headline and metrics Lato Black, body/source Georgia. New text min33px, body35px, headline51px. DO NOT RENDER ANY OF THIS TEXT IN THE BACKGROUND. It will be accurately set afterwards. Reserve x104\u2013961 y164\u20131536 for the news. NO rendered words, no watermark, no logo, no red guides, no added credit/footer. Create only this convincing quiet ivory-and-green environment with the empty physical circular mount."
